'''Dungeons''' are [[Combat|combat]] [[Mini-Games|minigames]]. They are ranked according to their difficulty on a scale from one to five, with one being easiest and five being hardest. Dungeons appear on the [[Atlas]], and have static locations with entrances. Their entrances typically appear as a barrier, such as boards across a cave entrance or a warning sign chained across a path. [[Collections]] for the combat [[Jobs|jobs]] are found within dungeons.

==Difficulty Ratings==
* Difficulty 1 - Can be entered by anyone.
* Difficulty 2 - Recommended levels 3 and higher, but can be entered by anyone.
* Difficulty 3 - Requires entry with a combat job at least level 5 or higher.
* Difficulty 4 - Requires entry with a combat job at least level 9 or higher.
* Difficulty 5 - Requires entry with a combat job at least level 13 or higher.

